## Interface: 16001
## Title: Polestar Freestyle
## Notes: Community addon for Polestar: a Quests section (every quest by zone and chain, with what it asks, its story, XP and rewards), a Gear section (the upgrades quests, dungeons and rares give you), and Freestyle questing (your quest log as a guide). /polestar quests, /freequest gear, /polestar free
